# FSD Architecture

The project uses Feature-Sliced Design. Details in `docs/fsd-architecture.md`.

## Layers (imports only go downward)

```
app → pages → widgets → features → entities → shared
```

## Slice file structure

```
slice-name/
  slice-name.api.ts       # API calls
  slice-name.model.ts     # Zustand store
  slice-name.types.ts     # TypeScript types
  slice-name.lib.ts       # Pure utilities
  slice-name.ui.tsx       # React component
  slice-name.test.ts      # Tests
```

