## Where to place code

| What | Layer | Path |
|------|-------|------|
| Zustand store (domain data) | entities | `entities/<name>/<name>.model.ts` |
| API functions (fetch/post) | entities | `entities/<name>/<name>.api.ts` |
| Domain types | entities | `entities/<name>/<name>.types.ts` |
| User scenario | features | `features/<action>/` |
| Composite UI block | widgets | `widgets/<name>/` |
| Page (route) | pages | `pages/<name>/` |
| UI primitive (Avatar, Button) | shared | `shared/ui/` |
| Utility (format, html, guards) | shared | `shared/lib/` |
| Fetch helpers | shared | `shared/api/` |
| Icons | shared | `shared/assets/icons/` |
| Constants | shared | `shared/config/` |

## Rules

- No barrel `index.ts` re-exports (see `no-barrel-index.mdc`).
- Import from concrete files (e.g. `import { useUsersStore } from "~/entities/user/user.model"`).
- Cross-store access — only downward or at the same level
- New features — create as FSD features from the start
- Tests live next to source: `slice-name.test.ts` inside the slice directory
